title: "Odysseus Local AI Windows Evaluation"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-01"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23949700"
repository-code: "https://github.com/griffinstalha/odysseus-local-ai-windows-evaluation"

authors:
  - family-names: "Shakeel"
    given-names: "Talha"

abstract: >-
  A reproducible systems evaluation of the Odysseus self-hosted agentic AI
  workspace on constrained Windows consumer hardware, covering local LLM
  inference, RAG, vector memory, agent-tool reliability, filesystem boundary
  behavior, deployment observations, and reproducibility controls.

keywords:
  - local LLM
  - agentic AI
  - RAG
  - AI agents
  - Ollama
  - reproducibility
  - software evaluation
  - Windows
  - GPU benchmarking

